#. max 47 bytes
msgctxt "0"
msgid "Love of Harems"
msgstr "Amante de Haréns"

#. max 1999 bytes
msgctxt "1"
msgid "Saber's first SG.\n\nHer true name may be unknown, but anyways,\nit's one of the deeds of her life, doing as she pleased.\nBasically, with the use of Imperial Privilege and such,\nshe kept beautiful boys and girls.\n \nEnjoying singing, models of sculpture, getting massages,\noccasionally letting them join her in the latest games:\nit seems she indulged her whims as much as she wished.\n\n             ◆\n\nBesides the harem, she opened tournaments in her name,\nappearing in Olympia (root of olympic) to become champion,\nboasting herself an artist like Apollo, the God of Music\nor a charioteer the likes of Sol, God of the Sun;\nwhether then or now, her love for showiness hasn't changed.\n\n……it may come as a surprise, but before she became\nemperor, she was a judge known for her impartiality.\nAll her showiness came about after she became emperor.\nPerhaps she considered the emperor \"a light like the sun,\nnecessary and essential to people and the world,\"\nand was performing that role with all her might.\n"
msgstr ""

